: 宋体;\">条件下，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a9f4c70a39d152f5e82eb3f308bd65ec.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"2\" size=\"10\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（列出计算式。以分压表示，分压</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/6706fe00b4e231e62d9ecbec567d526b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">总压</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2468403b3eba9e40bfa36f464e927738.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">物质的量分数）。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M4WwyIj8UWzUpTwkBWNk7Hp\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（3）</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">600~1000℃</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/6dd3beb12512ad2e76b5824b89032907.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">随温度升高而减小的原因是</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"3\" size=\"34\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅲ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．在含有活性炭的固定床反应器内，利用</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7644a7769a5fa1bdab46cc0b2dee2861.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">还原</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3cd6200aa9357b208a994c93c210ff60.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3cd6200aa9357b208a994c93c210ff60.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转化率、</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/530f5b63e797195906285c0c03eb9276.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选择性</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/396a8da165c6b54ba125ed5789035c0d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">随初始</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/afadee77fb83d55677dfaf4f15ea0c88.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以及温度的变化如</span><span>图2。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><img  height=\"210\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/21/8e5d20a3-4a60-4db4-8420-d25158366f60.png\" width=\"282\" /></p><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M4WwyIj8UWzUpTwkBWNk7Hp\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（4）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">反应生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/530f5b63e797195906285c0c03eb9276.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的最佳条件是</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"4\" size=\"10\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M4WwyIj8UWzUpTwkBWNk7Hp\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（5）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高温下，该体系中可检测出</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e5a122e25cf4eb9f03ffe5ec823bfc31.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，若反应器内无活性炭，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/530f5b63e797195906285c0c03eb9276.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">产率达最大时，所需的初始</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/afadee77fb83d55677dfaf4f15ea0c88.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">将</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"5\" size=\"10\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（填“增大”“不变”或“减小”）。</span></p></div></div><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ⅳ</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">．我国科研人员设计双室电解池（图</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）合成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/6883a710e2332dba382797abea275a49.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9c38c6b842b451f57d81f9f8dd320e4c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，实现</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3cd6200aa9357b208a994c93c210ff60.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的再利用。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><img  height=\"180\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/21/423d946a-fc55-4494-8f40-1e5fe76b22c0.png\" width=\"253\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">已知：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/161d60b5763e8b75803350aac26728ce.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">氧化性强于</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ad60241600751443a89557c09ced8b5c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M4WwyIj8UWzUpTwkBWNk7Hp\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（6）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电解时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a8b6ede55013761f0df50ef4854cb9d4.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"6\" size=\"10\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室移向</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"7\" size=\"10\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室（选填“</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/fc2a39beea5adf5d07aea0424ca7a64f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">”“</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/581c04af30b490da1a50555f9c89125c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">”）。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M4WwyIj8UWzUpTwkBWNk7Hp\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（7）</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">若将恰好吸收了</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b2d9374d08dcdd4f07e10927b37100a9.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bf46424c492d094dd6cc9bd506b23c55.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">溶液全部注入</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/fc2a39beea5adf5d07aea0424ca7a64f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室，电解时</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/fc2a39beea5adf5d07aea0424ca7a64f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极的电极反应式为</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"8\" size=\"10\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；当</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/581c04af30b490da1a50555f9c89125c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室内生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/89404da1d97447fd060dc1d360f3a71a.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/fc2a39beea5adf5d07aea0424ca7a64f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室理论上最多可生成</span><span class=\"qml-bk\" index=\"9\" size=\"10\" type=\"underline\" style=\"text-decoration:underline\" >　　　　　　　　　　</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">mol</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d224ea5909da0e4cf650af824c750452.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div></div>",
  "answer": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-answer\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M4WwyIj8UWzUpTwkBWNk7Hp\">（1）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4200f6f54551cce474023bae93739f52.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（2）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3db81fb3282015eab4b6807abc154981.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（3）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/da7d0bca7ea339641ac6476bea92ab57.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">之间时，温度升高，促使</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7f5fda6e60fba9020bd6951829844ec8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分解为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a16736cc2de4aaa74d39cf51271fc145.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，使</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7f5fda6e60fba9020bd6951829844ec8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的物质的量分数减小</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（4）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b41f789dbf3bfd1809cc502b0f9db909.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4797e6cc7f8ed718abb98f29688ad380.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（5）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">增大</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（6）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;②. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">b</span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（7）<span class=\"qml-an-sq\" id-container=\"question\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/87adea81d4d4ca65a865cf480f0f0409.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f6df3d8e02d7e827ceed3620ca5a31a3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;②. <span class=\"qml-an  \"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/63d9c3457bb110ade51370f2eed4a0b3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>",
  "explanation": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-explanation\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M4WwyIj8UWzUpTwkBWNk7Hp\"><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(1)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">观察目标反应</span><span>③</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，可以通过组合反应</span><span>①</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span>②</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">得到。将反应</span><span>①</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">乘以</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，得到</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/179ff16e9bc0cb7745ce850d20fc4178.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。将上述式子减去反应</span><span>②</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bb5faa2f122839b7fe13471da65b0cd2.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，化简得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f7721346a5f2d67a8d0a37824f91b7b3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">这正是反应</span><span>③</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。因此</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/780c65141bf42b92077fd19f87056589.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(2)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">根据图</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，在</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d3c64afaa2c36fad5998e7bcd018cac5.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，各物质的物质的量分数如下：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/fc8fca032e126753ec00d22b701f6a2d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/cc1b059f9f14f73153d7571fc69c8610.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/20dd299ca3a313246a6a6c4be88172eb.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e7760df16fc93bec2e45b5166ab9f4e5.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。由于体系中存在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a7caf55d47194882cfcd0ee0896b9cda.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等硫单质，且总物质的量分数之和为</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。已知</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/277aa3a03cd2f9bf496977a057d363c0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e799f307808a6f558ebc4a104d7291b0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，即硫单质以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a7caf55d47194882cfcd0ee0896b9cda.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">形态存在。所以</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f6f18ecc0870a223e8e83b1f91e19abd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。反应</span><span>③</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f7721346a5f2d67a8d0a37824f91b7b3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，其平衡常数表达式为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/48c7a985f37b48c18eb5273bdb5b89f0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。已知总压</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b3fbbf3cbfce1458b9ade502ba415558.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，分压</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/6d9c932d55ca1fc13676599e3de8ffac.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。代入各物质的量分数和总压：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/62cf4fc0284b0b52b693214291e1b725.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(3)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">观察图</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/da7d0bca7ea339641ac6476bea92ab57.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">区间，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7f5fda6e60fba9020bd6951829844ec8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的物质的量分数下降，而</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a16736cc2de4aaa74d39cf51271fc145.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的物质的量分数上升。这说明在此温度范围内，反应</span><span>②</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的逆反应占主导。由于温度升高，平衡向吸热方向移动，说明</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7f5fda6e60fba9020bd6951829844ec8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分解是吸热过程。温度升高，促使</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7f5fda6e60fba9020bd6951829844ec8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分解为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a16736cc2de4aaa74d39cf51271fc145.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，导致</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7f5fda6e60fba9020bd6951829844ec8.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的物质的量分数减小。</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(4)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">S</span><sub word-font=\"Times New Roman\"><span>2</span></sub><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的产率</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> =</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4b0ac6b7a7b173d822b49067dcfa6458.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转化率</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2468403b3eba9e40bfa36f464e927738.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选择性。我们需要在图</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中寻找两者乘积最大的点。观察图</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">中的曲线：实心圆（</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4b0ac6b7a7b173d822b49067dcfa6458.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转化率）：随</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/74649aec18781bbf782886dd11a79abe.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">增大而增大，随温度升高而降低。空心方块（</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选择性）：随</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/74649aec18781bbf782886dd11a79abe.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">增大而降低，随温度升高而升高。寻找最佳组合：在</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b41f789dbf3bfd1809cc502b0f9db909.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选择性最高。当</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4797e6cc7f8ed718abb98f29688ad380.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b41f789dbf3bfd1809cc502b0f9db909.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4b0ac6b7a7b173d822b49067dcfa6458.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">转化率达到了较高水平，且</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">选择性依然保持在较高水平。此时两者的乘积（产率）达到最大。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">因此，最佳条件是</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b41f789dbf3bfd1809cc502b0f9db909.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4797e6cc7f8ed718abb98f29688ad380.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(5)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">高温下检测到</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/31dd10c75ef9e20cac8696eb379e4927.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，说明活性炭参与了反应。活性炭的存在可能会消耗</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4b0ac6b7a7b173d822b49067dcfa6458.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a16736cc2de4aaa74d39cf51271fc145.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，从而在一定程度上辅助生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。若反应器内无活性炭，则没有这些副反应。为了达到相同的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b16361a6814db5b467a3ca83956eb26d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">产率，就需要依靠初始投入的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a16736cc2de4aaa74d39cf51271fc145.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">来还原</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4b0ac6b7a7b173d822b49067dcfa6458.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。因此，所需的初始</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/74649aec18781bbf782886dd11a79abe.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">将增大。</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(6)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">观察图</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> 3 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电解池：</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室：通入</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4b0ac6b7a7b173d822b49067dcfa6458.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/99e6de649e176790f06bc80c2301d4f6.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">溶液。</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4b0ac6b7a7b173d822b49067dcfa6458.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">具有还原性，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ffe0b58edda365945d96966e0f41fd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">具有氧化性，两者在溶液中发生反应：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5f12483b71c3899c6286552cd6b615a6.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">b </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室：通入</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4d169aea963db20812bafd987dcd52fa.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ce7643b0c4041057e0bea2aa4466f682.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4d169aea963db20812bafd987dcd52fa.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">得电子发生还原反应，说明</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">b</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极为阴极。既然</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">b </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极为阴极，则</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极为阳极。电解池中，阳离子向阴极移动。因此，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/42e881ccaa98b5612366b2b7965a9f3d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">从阳极室（</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室）移向阴极室（</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">b</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室）。</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\" id-container=\"question\">(7)小问详解： <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室发生氧化反应。溶液中存在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bebdb2b4633bfc703b785926c25ff96e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/cb66814695d1ae2e75adb37e89f60257.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。已知</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ac81007b3577c21bab08aeff88a451.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">氧化性强于</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ffe0b58edda365945d96966e0f41fd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，根据氧化还原规律，还原性</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9ef3c4a9f009d0f4fdc04ef9a1c9cd67.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。所以阳极上，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bebdb2b4633bfc703b785926c25ff96e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">优先失去电子被氧化为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ffe0b58edda365945d96966e0f41fd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">；当</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bebdb2b4633bfc703b785926c25ff96e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消耗完毕后，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/cb66814695d1ae2e75adb37e89f60257.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">再失去电子被氧化为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ac81007b3577c21bab08aeff88a451.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。电极反应式为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/87adea81d4d4ca65a865cf480f0f0409.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f6df3d8e02d7e827ceed3620ca5a31a3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。计算生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/52bcb7e4e46a5070c5560b2cc74a177f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的物质的量：吸收</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a80d6cbbbc413a14cbf4d6ee89b8ec3e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的反应：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/8f6a0c57c5034380d1fb4ddced3e2179.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">消耗</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a80d6cbbbc413a14cbf4d6ee89b8ec3e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/57b86a781051dd22eed2a73393f15190.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a90653a43d052868718a04304a6da2fd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">b</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e983b784f7b6b2db62b3a2ad4946092d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：阴极反应：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3c9af3a886020e15d43d8feb7827303b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e983b784f7b6b2db62b3a2ad4946092d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">需要转移</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/85f0af0b2b62390d2fc2c7931fc9f717.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子。根据电子守恒，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室也转移</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/85f0af0b2b62390d2fc2c7931fc9f717.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子。阳极首先氧化</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bebdb2b4633bfc703b785926c25ff96e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：溶液中有</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/57b86a781051dd22eed2a73393f15190.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，将其全部氧化为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ffe0b58edda365945d96966e0f41fd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">需要失去</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2a85c69fd98b8dd41cb29aecf89919b7.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子。此时，总共转移了</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/85f0af0b2b62390d2fc2c7931fc9f717.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子，还剩余</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/c560b40b0e7e18be0c265b0a56515adb.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子。剩余的电子由</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/cb66814695d1ae2e75adb37e89f60257.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">放电提供：</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4dabe693b3b778577b66d0de476a4f82.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">失去</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2a85c69fd98b8dd41cb29aecf89919b7.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电子，生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1487d8ad2c0156b2ee177a169125bfe6.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。最终在</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极室中，生成了</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ffe0b58edda365945d96966e0f41fd.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ac81007b3577c21bab08aeff88a451.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。体系中生成的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a2ac81007b3577c21bab08aeff88a451.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/973ccfc7cf461f97a54a57ea0563efda.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。根据化学式</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/52bcb7e4e46a5070c5560b2cc74a177f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ee8d6bcaa2fc194572e332ad53895027.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">需要</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ec04297900dfab2c9ff831b790182936.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。因此</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1487d8ad2c0156b2ee177a169125bfe6.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">理论上最多可结合生成</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4f164edca27f2ba4b418431ab886db22.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div>",
